Looking across Hout Bay, there are four prominent buttresses along the Panorama path that runs form Blackburn Ravine to Noordhoek Peak.  No names have been found for these so they have been called (from North to South) Blackburn Buttress, Blackburn Major (because it's higher than Blackburn Buttress), Noordhoek Minor (it's lower than Noordhoek) and then Noordhoek Peak. The route goes straight up Blackburn Major (see also
Noordhoek Minor
